# HuggingFace API Token Configuration
# 
# This file should contain your HuggingFace API token for cloud-based embeddings.
# Cloud mode is the default and recommended for M1 Mac compatibility.
#
# To get your token:
# 1. Go to: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# 2. Create a new token (read access is sufficient)
# 3. Copy the token
# 4. Replace the line below with your actual token (remove the #)
#
# YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
#
# Example (DO NOT use this fake token):
# hf_AbCdEfGhIjKlMnOpQrStUvWxYz123456789
#
# Security Note: 
# - This file contains sensitive credentials
# - Do NOT commit this file to version control
# - Add hf.txt to your .gitignore file
